                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bb28c0e9-39f0-37d8-9e7d-4cebaf05b55c",
                        "entry_id": "c12759d0-b691-3bc3-96c8-2418b9ef1d8d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "diminutive of ноль (nolʹ); a (little) zero"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "diminutive",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8056515c-4480-4548-9c6b-e3e26cdf606f",
                                "sense_id": "bb28c0e9-39f0-37d8-9e7d-4cebaf05b55c",
                                "text": "Да в других руках оно и трех гривенников не стоило, а недельки через две не тремя запахло; в моих-то руках, любезнейший, оно то есть вот как развернулось, что, пожалуй, к трем-то и два нолика без греха приписать бы можно — вот что.",
                                "translation": "In another man's hands, it would not be worth even three dimes, but two weeks later it was nothing like three dimes; in my hands, most kind sir, it turned out in such a manner that I could then in full honesty write two little zeroes after that three: that's how it went.",
                                "english": "In another man's hands, it would not be worth even three dimes, but two weeks later it was nothing like three dimes; in my hands, most kind sir, it turned out in such a manner that I could then in full honesty write two little zeroes after that three: that's how it went."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b861db90-94d9-3e2d-a850-c47700a1f8c5",
                        "entry_id": "c12759d0-b691-3bc3-96c8-2418b9ef1d8d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a little circle (symbol)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b97ec1d-a13d-4a8c-a235-16dd2312eaca",
                                "sense_id": "b861db90-94d9-3e2d-a850-c47700a1f8c5",
                                "text": "Все эти упражнения — прямая черточка, черточка с крючком внизу, черточка с двумя крючками и нолик — пишутся с одного почерка, не отрывая руки от доски.",
                                "translation": "All of these exercises – a straight stroke, a stroke with a hook down, a stroke with two hooks, and a little circle – are to be written in a single motion, without lifting the hand from the blackboard.",
                                "english": "All of these exercises – a straight stroke, a stroke with a hook down, a stroke with two hooks, and a little circle – are to be written in a single motion, without lifting the hand from the blackboard."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
